00:44:57.840 --> 00:44:58.500
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Karamihan po.

asr-000779
00:44:58.740 --> 00:44:59.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So haanapin?

asr-000796
00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:07.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung nari hahanapin si Alfredo Flores, saan ba yung letter A, anong agency siya?

asr-000797
00:45:07.180 --> 00:45:12.280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo, nakakalungkot man pong tanggapin pero karamihan ng ating records sa civil service ay paper-based.

asr-000798
00:45:12.860 --> 00:45:16.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Have you asked yung mga matagal na po dyan sa CSC anong nangyari?

asr-000799
00:45:16.840 --> 00:45:25.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Because we heard that kayo po yung repository ng ikang employment na nasa gobyerno tapos naka-folder pa.

asr-000800
00:45:25.340 --> 00:45:26.160
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kaya po urgent po yun?

asr-000801
00:45:26.160 --> 00:45:26.720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hanggang ngayon?

asr-000802
00:45:26.720 --> 00:45:29.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo, marami po kasi limited lang po.

asr-000803
00:45:29.440 --> 00:45:31.300
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Some have digitized, in fairness.

asr-000804
00:45:31.900 --> 00:45:36.780
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Digitization started somewhere in 2022 and 2023.

asr-000805
00:45:37.200 --> 00:45:42.160
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero ang migration po kasi, like scanning lang po, limited din po ang scanners namin.

asr-000806
00:45:42.440 --> 00:45:45.860
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Matagal na hindi po nag-request if you can see the history of the budget.

asr-000807
00:45:45.920 --> 00:45:51.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I've been hearing, Attorney Chairman Yap, about this modernization.

asr-000808
00:45:51.660 --> 00:45:56.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Since time immemorial pa ito, wala pa nga itong administration na ito.

asr-000809
00:45:56.840 --> 00:45:58.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: They're talking about ikang modernization.

asr-000810
00:45:59.440 --> 00:46:06.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: In time of Duterte, atras pa tayo, time of Pinoy, they've been talking about modernizing our system.

asr-000811
00:46:06.480 --> 00:46:07.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Bakit ho, anong nangyari dito?

asr-000812
00:46:08.060 --> 00:46:09.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, I cannot understand.

asr-000813
00:46:09.300 --> 00:46:17.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Well, I cannot blame you, but have you asked people na nariyan na sa CSC bago ka pa dumating na kung anong nangyari?

asr-000814
00:46:18.600 --> 00:46:19.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Haven't they requested?

asr-000815
00:46:20.180 --> 00:46:25.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I think, sir, it's more of a mindset sa ating mga tao sa pamahalaan.

asr-000816
00:46:25.440 --> 00:46:29.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang tingin po kasi nila sa modernization, sa digitization.

asr-000817
00:46:29.440 --> 00:46:36.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Basta may laptop na, may computer na, parang nandun na tayo.

asr-000818
00:46:36.440 --> 00:46:43.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero hindi nila nakikita yung, they have to be used as a unified system to process documents.

asr-000819
00:46:43.440 --> 00:46:46.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Hindi po nakarating sa ganong pag-isip.

asr-000820
00:46:46.440 --> 00:46:48.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Napabilis ang pag-type, napabilis ang pag...

asr-000821
00:46:48.440 --> 00:46:56.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Malay natin itong sinasabi kong itong isang tao dito, nagtatrabaho sa isang department, nagsasideline sa isang department.

asr-000822
00:46:56.440 --> 00:46:57.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: How would you know?

asr-000823
00:46:57.440 --> 00:46:57.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Exactly.

asr-000824
00:46:57.940 --> 00:46:58.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung wala sa system.

asr-000825
00:46:58.940 --> 00:47:00.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Whereas kung ipapunch mo yung pangalan niya...

asr-000826
00:47:00.940 --> 00:47:01.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Magalaman po ka.

asr-000827
00:47:01.940 --> 00:47:06.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: For example, Erwin Tulba, dito ka pala nagtatrabaho sa Senado, tapos meron ka pang sideline sa department na ganito.

asr-000828
00:47:06.940 --> 00:47:07.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo.

asr-000829
00:47:07.440 --> 00:47:10.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya kung put out mo yung record, iba yung record na doon, iba yung record.

asr-000830
00:47:10.940 --> 00:47:11.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tama po. Tama po kayo.

asr-000831
00:47:11.940 --> 00:47:12.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi naguusap.

asr-000832
00:47:12.940 --> 00:47:19.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Do you think may mga ganyan tayo na nagmu-moonlight na mga employees because hindi pa po modernize tayo?

asr-000833
00:47:19.940 --> 00:47:20.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: What is your assessment?

asr-000834
00:47:20.940 --> 00:47:21.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I cannot discount...

asr-000835
00:47:21.940 --> 00:47:22.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So let me ask your opinion.

asr-000836
00:47:22.940 --> 00:47:25.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I cannot discount the possibility na meron pong ganon.

asr-000837
00:47:25.940 --> 00:47:27.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi hindi naman po mabilis maghukay ng paper.

asr-000838
00:47:27.940 --> 00:47:28.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Exactly.

asr-000839
00:47:28.940 --> 00:47:29.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Paper documents.

asr-000840
00:47:29.940 --> 00:47:36.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kaya nga po ang una naming step is meron na po tayong electronic na po ang PDS, personal data sheet.

asr-000841
00:47:36.940 --> 00:47:41.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So ang submission is electronic, diretso na po sa database, ikaklassify na po natin.

asr-000842
00:47:41.940 --> 00:47:46.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: At mas madali pong ma-access for policy planning and program development.

asr-000843
00:47:46.940 --> 00:47:52.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi pag mag-planning ka ng succession, alam mo kung gaano katagal ang... ilan ang average years in government.

asr-000844
00:47:52.940 --> 00:47:54.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ano yung mga retirement periods.

asr-000845
00:47:54.940 --> 00:47:55.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Right.

asr-000846
00:47:55.940 --> 00:47:57.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Gaano ka katagal mag-i-estate.

asr-000847
00:47:57.940 --> 00:48:05.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya is that also the reason why matagal makakuha ng pensyon yung mga ibang employees natin dahil kailangan hanapin pa.

asr-000848
00:48:05.940 --> 00:48:08.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sabi nandoon pumunta ka sa letter H.

asr-000849
00:48:08.940 --> 00:48:09.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo.

asr-000850
00:48:09.940 --> 00:48:12.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tapos pa puro alikabuk na. May agyo pa nga.

asr-000851
00:48:12.940 --> 00:48:15.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo. Mas masakit pa po pag inulan yan at natunaw.

asr-000852
00:48:15.940 --> 00:48:16.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ay.

asr-000853
00:48:16.940 --> 00:48:18.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pinanay.

asr-000854
00:48:18.940 --> 00:48:26.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: That's very sad. Pero anong sinasabi na since time immemorial walang plano. Panahon nila Pinoy.

asr-000855
00:48:26.940 --> 00:48:28.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, let's backtrack.

asr-000856
00:48:28.940 --> 00:48:35.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Naririnig ko na po yung usapan na yan. I don't know what's going on. And it's a very serious problem.

asr-000857
00:48:35.940 --> 00:48:42.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, yung mga staff ko, diba, kailangan na, dapat nandyan sila sa repository po ninyo.

asr-000858
00:48:42.940 --> 00:48:43.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo.

asr-000859
00:48:43.940 --> 00:48:49.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And if you're a repository, eh dapat hindi nyo po mga folder-folder lang paano pag kinain ng daga.

asr-000860
00:48:49.940 --> 00:48:53.060
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kaya nga po urgent yung aming mga programs kasi ano.

asr-000861
00:48:53.300 --> 00:48:57.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay. Well, I support you on this. Good. Continue po. How many more minutes do you have there?

asr-000865
00:48:57.920 --> 00:48:58.880
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kontina lang po siguro.

asr-000866
00:48:59.000 --> 00:49:04.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Go ahead, because we still have a Career Executive Service Board and of course our DOT.

asr-000867
00:49:04.180 --> 00:49:11.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo. Yung mga iba na lang po ay, like yung Learning... Everything kasi po pwedeng digitalized from Learning and Management Systems.

asr-000868
00:49:11.940 --> 00:49:20.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And then pati yung, fantasia po kasi namin na pag ang registration para sa exam ng Civil Service ay continuing registration

asr-000869
00:49:20.940 --> 00:49:23.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: para hindi nagkaklag yung system.

asr-000870
00:49:23.940 --> 00:49:24.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Dereder. Basta register ka lang ng registration.

asr-000871
00:49:24.940 --> 00:49:43.820
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I-register ka lang ng register tapos tatawagan ka and then ikaw ay number 500 para ka sa August. Meron na lang cut-off, continuing na po yung registration. Tapos digitize na rin pati yung pag-exam and within one day, yun ang aming balak for 2027, makuha mo yung results kasama na yung kopya ng iyong eligibility.

asr-000872
00:49:43.820 --> 00:49:58.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi ngayon po ang eligibility namin ay nasa CSEVs na authenticated na hindi ka na kailangang sumulat at magpaano. The one that you will download from the CSEVs of the Civil Service will now be considered as an authenticated eligibility document.

asr-000873
00:49:58.800 --> 00:50:13.640
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So kasama po ito sa mga gagawin namin. And then we hope also to digitize our legal, our adjudication system para mabawasan po, mas mabilis po ang processing ng kaso at mawala na po yung mga aging cases na dumarating hanggang tatlo.

asr-000874
00:50:13.640 --> 00:50:21.760
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So apat na taon. Kasi patay na yung humihingi ng ayuda or ng legal assistance, eh hindi pa natatapos yung kanyang kaso.

asr-000875
00:50:22.660 --> 00:50:33.920
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Overall, these initiatives for the 2027 are designed to create more integrated digital and efficient systems that will improve how the CSEV delivers services to the Civil Service.

asr-000876
00:50:33.920 --> 00:50:39.200
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Sana po, bigyan niyo po ako ng pagkataon na i-present yung aming mga...

asr-000877
00:50:39.200 --> 00:50:43.620
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Baka naman po, maawa po kayo sa aming...

asr-000878
00:50:43.640 --> 00:50:51.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Nagdagan po ninyo ang budget namin kasi hindi naman po kami nakakapaghingi pa except dito sa PCSMP ng malaking budget.

asr-000879
00:50:51.900 --> 00:50:55.520
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi maraming na po sa aming regional infrastructure by priority.

asr-000880
00:50:56.020 --> 00:51:03.860
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Regional offices and field offices, nakikituloy lang po kami sa mga local government units or other offices in the regions.

asr-000881
00:51:04.440 --> 00:51:09.960
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: At karamihan sa kanila ay either kulang na po ng space for us.

asr-000882
00:51:09.960 --> 00:51:11.960
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung isa po namin sa...

asr-000883
00:51:13.640 --> 00:51:17.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: My next question, para mapadali tayo, Chairman.

asr-000884
00:51:17.860 --> 00:51:18.280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yes po.

asr-000885
00:51:18.880 --> 00:51:25.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nagre-request po kayo ng restoration of unfunded proposal amounting to 783 million. Tama po ba?

asr-000886
00:51:27.140 --> 00:51:28.640
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I think...

asr-000887
00:51:28.640 --> 00:51:31.740
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Nasa letter po namin...

asr-000888
00:51:31.740 --> 00:51:32.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yeah, 783 million.

asr-000889
00:51:32.800 --> 00:51:33.320
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yes po.

asr-000890
00:51:34.160 --> 00:51:35.020
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Nakalista po doon.

asr-000891
00:51:35.020 --> 00:51:39.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mayroon po the breakdown of this request and CSE's justification.

asr-000892
00:51:40.080 --> 00:51:42.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At saka, kagaya po sinasabi, sana mo pagbigyan kayo.

asr-000893
00:51:43.640 --> 00:51:47.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano ang justification nito? What if hindi po ito mabigay ng komite?

asr-000894
00:51:48.500 --> 00:51:51.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano po ang effect nito sa services ng CSE?

asr-000895
00:51:52.060 --> 00:51:59.900
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Well, in the meantime, we will make do. Pero ang importante po kasi yung mga regional field offices at saka major field offices.

asr-000896
00:52:00.320 --> 00:52:06.640
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Nilista po namin sa submission namin na doon sa buo, may we request that we submit it na lang, sir.

asr-000897
00:52:06.720 --> 00:52:09.560
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kagaya po nitong sa Region 3, sir, sa San Fernando.

asr-000898
00:52:09.580 --> 00:52:11.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Well, anyway, ma'am,

asr-000899
00:52:11.620 --> 00:52:13.200
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Sasagasaan po ng national highway.

asr-000900
00:52:13.200 --> 00:52:17.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Your budget will be brought before the plenary and then masasama po ito sa BICAM.

asr-000901
00:52:17.120 --> 00:52:18.640
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung details po, ibibigay po namin.

asr-000902
00:52:18.760 --> 00:52:20.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Please submit it to the committee, ma'am.

asr-000903
00:52:20.620 --> 00:52:25.340
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung mga iba po is operational mobility kasi seven years old na po ang mga fleet namin.

asr-000904
00:52:25.560 --> 00:52:32.860
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Karamihan na po, mas mahal po i-repair at i-maintain kesa yung bumili na lang po ng bago, especially for regional operations po.

asr-000905
00:52:33.120 --> 00:52:41.620
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: At yung huli po, mayroon po kami sanang hingin kasi dahil mataas ang power requirements ng itong modernization program,

asr-000906
00:52:41.620 --> 00:52:55.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: we would like to establish a solar energy project at the central office para yung frontline services hindi po na-upend ng mga brownouts at saka pag may bagyo and then...

asr-000907
00:52:55.540 --> 00:52:56.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: How much would that be?

asr-000908
00:52:56.600 --> 00:53:01.980
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang initial po na mura lang naman sa initial po kasi 22 million po.

asr-000909
00:53:01.980 --> 00:53:04.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pwede ho nating ilaban yan. Alright.

asr-000910
00:53:05.620 --> 00:53:08.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yun lang po. Maraming salamat po sa inyong panahon.

asr-000911
00:53:08.500 --> 00:53:08.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you.

asr-000912
00:53:08.960 --> 00:53:10.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I just have a... Yeah, yun yung...

asr-000913
00:53:11.620 --> 00:53:12.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: My last question for you.

asr-000914
00:53:13.100 --> 00:53:13.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-000915
00:53:16.280 --> 00:53:21.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: What do you do dun sa mga empleyado natin na sa gobyerno na walang kapit, na walang koneksyon?

asr-000916
00:53:22.540 --> 00:53:24.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Marami po ako naririnig na ganito.

asr-000917
00:53:25.840 --> 00:53:28.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tagal ko na po, senator, 15 years na po.

asr-000918
00:53:28.860 --> 00:53:32.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi po ako ma-promote kasi wala po akong kapit, wala po akong connect.

asr-000919
00:53:33.400 --> 00:53:37.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sabi ko, nag-accomplish mo na ba? May mga study ka na ba? Masteral?

asr-000920
00:53:37.620 --> 00:53:38.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mayroon na po eh.

asr-000921
00:53:38.860 --> 00:53:40.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ito na nga po, doctorate na po ako eh.

asr-000922
00:53:40.620 --> 00:53:43.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero hindi pa po ako na po-promote. Bakit?

asr-000923
00:53:43.720 --> 00:53:48.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Wala pong connection eh. Yung pinili po, yung junior sa akin, na wala namang qualification.

asr-000924
00:53:48.820 --> 00:53:50.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: What do you do when you hear this?

asr-000925
00:53:51.260 --> 00:53:55.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May naririnig ba kayong ganito in your office as a chairman?

asr-000926
00:53:55.460 --> 00:53:57.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Marami po. Marami po.

asr-000927
00:53:57.940 --> 00:53:58.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: What do you do?

asr-000928
00:54:01.680 --> 00:54:05.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Osa, can you please tell the other room to keep it down?

asr-000929
00:54:07.340 --> 00:54:09.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung sino man yung mga bisita nila dyan.

asr-000930
00:54:10.620 --> 00:54:12.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Go ahead, chairman.

asr-000931
00:54:12.660 --> 00:54:22.340
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung mga ganun po. Again, sir, parang hands-tied kami kasi discretion po ito ng agency head kasi appointing authority sila.

asr-000932
00:54:22.340 --> 00:54:29.960
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero pag dumating naman po sa amin, kung yung qualifications niya talaga ay kulang, kasi i-check po namin eh.

asr-000933
00:54:30.760 --> 00:54:38.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero ibig sabihin, nangyayari pa rin ba ito at this day and age na kompleto na po siya ng requirement?

asr-000934
00:54:38.840 --> 00:54:40.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yan po ang problema sa gobyerno natin.

asr-000935
00:54:40.620 --> 00:54:42.920
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi po na po promote because walang connect.

asr-000936
00:54:43.780 --> 00:54:45.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Graduate na po siya lahat na po ng requirement.

asr-000937
00:54:46.340 --> 00:54:49.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Na-accomplish niya na hanggang sa magre-retire na lang siya.

asr-000938
00:54:49.540 --> 00:54:52.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi po siya ma-promote-promote kasi wala po siyang connect.

asr-000939
00:54:52.600 --> 00:55:00.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or kung kasi, hindi sa ma-promote siya, nilalagyan dito, nilalagyan doon kung saan saan galing yung mga tao na para sa pwesto niya.

asr-000940
00:55:01.500 --> 00:55:03.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So what do you do about it?

asr-000941
00:55:04.080 --> 00:55:08.160
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kaya po namin, well, it will not be a solution to the problem.

asr-000942
00:55:08.540 --> 00:55:10.600
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But we are going to certify na po yung mga...

asr-000943
00:55:10.620 --> 00:55:13.680
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: HRMO, yung mga magpaproseso po ng mga ano.

asr-000944
00:55:14.080 --> 00:55:19.460
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And we are now, we are doing an overhaul of qualification standards.

asr-000945
00:55:20.060 --> 00:55:24.880
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Meron ho tayong tinatawag na para mag-shift na siya sa competency base.

asr-000946
00:55:24.880 --> 00:55:34.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Don't you ask your regional offices and then to check on government agencies to see who is due for promotion,

asr-000947
00:55:35.140 --> 00:55:37.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: who needs to be promoted sa agencies na ito?

asr-000948
00:55:38.020 --> 00:55:39.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or ask their HRMO?

asr-000949
00:55:40.620 --> 00:55:47.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: HR offices na submit, sino ba ang for promotion?

asr-000950
00:55:47.980 --> 00:55:51.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I think this is the problem, Chairman.

asr-000951
00:55:51.760 --> 00:55:55.080
