asr-000952
00:55:55.680 --> 00:56:01.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Na hindi po na-fill up kasi wala na po-promote dahil nga walang kapit or something.

asr-000953
00:56:02.120 --> 00:56:03.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Iba ang nailalagay.

asr-000954
00:56:04.140 --> 00:56:06.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ito talaga ang problema sa gobyerno natin.

asr-000955
00:56:06.620 --> 00:56:08.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And most of us here.

asr-000956
00:56:09.320 --> 00:56:10.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Most of us here.

asr-000957
00:56:10.620 --> 00:56:13.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I'm sure na-experience one time or another.

asr-000958
00:56:13.980 --> 00:56:19.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nag-gusto niyo ma-promote, kabatang-bata siya, lawyer siya, doktor siya, o ano man siya dyan,

asr-000959
00:56:19.420 --> 00:56:24.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sa City Health, o Municipal Health, sa Department of Justice, nagsisigasig.

asr-000960
00:56:25.540 --> 00:56:27.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero hindi po ma-promote kasi wala pong connect eh.

asr-000961
00:56:27.880 --> 00:56:34.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mauna itong si Atty. Tagpulano rito, nakaibigan ni Secretary o ni Director, yun po yun eh.

asr-000962
00:56:34.600 --> 00:56:36.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Real talk lang po tayo.

asr-000963
00:56:36.300 --> 00:56:38.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: How do we solve this issue now?

asr-000964
00:56:38.700 --> 00:56:40.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi may naririnig pa rin po.

asr-000965
00:56:40.620 --> 00:56:43.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hanggang ngayon na gano'n pa rin po ang problema.

asr-000966
00:56:43.520 --> 00:56:45.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I think that should be your mission, ma'am.

asr-000967
00:56:45.900 --> 00:56:52.840
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I think yung HRMISPS, sir, kasi naka-actual na na-upload mo yung mga records ng mga tao.

asr-000968
00:56:53.720 --> 00:56:55.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So this will solve that problem?

asr-000969
00:56:55.820 --> 00:56:56.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: It will, I think.

asr-000970
00:56:56.700 --> 00:56:57.920
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi makikita na po namin eh.

asr-000971
00:56:57.980 --> 00:57:02.360
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ngayon hindi po kami makapasok sa ENSA para tignan yung actual records nila.

asr-000972
00:57:02.960 --> 00:57:04.600
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Totoo bang ito ang bakante sa inyo?

asr-000973
00:57:04.700 --> 00:57:07.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pwede po nilang i-hide sa amin.

asr-000974
00:57:07.660 --> 00:57:10.500
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Dito, actual time, they have to submit it already.

asr-000975
00:57:10.620 --> 00:57:14.660
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So yung yun, makikita mo, ah, hindi nyo pinifill up ito, bakit?

asr-000976
00:57:14.960 --> 00:57:17.140
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ah, ito pala, marami nang pwedeng i-promote.

asr-000977
00:57:17.260 --> 00:57:18.680
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Bakit hindi kayo nag-promote?

asr-000978
00:57:18.960 --> 00:57:22.300
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: O matagal na pala, bakit hindi kayo nagpa-publish ng vacant positions?

asr-000979
00:57:23.020 --> 00:57:26.680
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tapos yung kanilang HRMPSB, yung Promotions Board, Selection Board,

asr-000980
00:57:27.000 --> 00:57:29.680
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: pati yung papeles nila, isasubmit dito sa system eh.

asr-000981
00:57:30.040 --> 00:57:35.480
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So makikita na ngayon ng system na, ah, itong ahensya na ito, kulang dito, kulang dito, kulang dito.

asr-000982
00:57:35.480 --> 00:57:40.560
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Then we can do the remedial measures with data, evidence,

asr-000983
00:57:40.620 --> 00:57:42.120
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: based na po yung action po namin.

asr-000984
00:57:42.400 --> 00:57:44.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sila mag-file ng complaint sa CSC.

asr-000985
00:57:44.780 --> 00:57:46.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kanino po sila pwede mag-file na?

asr-000986
00:57:47.320 --> 00:57:49.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Atorney or Ma'am Marilyn Yap?

asr-000987
00:57:49.740 --> 00:57:53.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ako po ay, ah, 25 years na po ako rito sa gobyerno.

asr-000988
00:57:54.240 --> 00:57:57.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dalaga pa po ako, may apo na po ako, hindi ako ma-promote, promote.

asr-000989
00:57:58.060 --> 00:58:00.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ah, ah, parang awa mo na.

asr-000990
00:58:00.880 --> 00:58:01.920
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pwede mo bang tulog?

asr-000991
00:58:02.080 --> 00:58:03.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi may mga dumadam po sa office ko.

asr-000992
00:58:04.120 --> 00:58:04.840
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo, opo.

asr-000993
00:58:04.840 --> 00:58:07.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Na maging congressman ako, senador, nagpapapromote.

asr-000994
00:58:07.720 --> 00:58:09.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sabi ko, ayaw ko na, tingnan ko nga.

asr-000995
00:58:09.860 --> 00:58:10.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kompleto naman.

asr-000996
00:58:10.620 --> 00:58:12.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So qualification, hindi lang talaga.

asr-000997
00:58:12.600 --> 00:58:14.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pag kinausap mo yung director, regional director,

asr-000998
00:58:14.980 --> 00:58:16.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: o kung ano man yan dyan, manager,

asr-000999
00:58:16.940 --> 00:58:18.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kung ano-ano sinasabi sa akin,

asr-001000
00:58:18.620 --> 00:58:21.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kaya hindi pa qualified, kaya time in grade, time in position.

asr-001001
00:58:22.080 --> 00:58:23.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero qualified naman, ho.

asr-001002
00:58:23.860 --> 00:58:25.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, I really do not understand.

asr-001003
00:58:25.400 --> 00:58:27.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pwede ba sila magreklamo sa inyo na,

asr-001004
00:58:27.900 --> 00:58:30.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ikang, ah, na hindi siya napopromote?

asr-001005
00:58:32.060 --> 00:58:35.720
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Walang, wala kasing specific na kaso sa hindi napopromote.

asr-001006
00:58:36.800 --> 00:58:37.620
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Unless, unless...

asr-001007
00:58:38.240 --> 00:58:39.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Wala po kayong, ah, ikang department.

asr-001008
00:58:39.860 --> 00:58:40.120
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Walang ganun, ho.

asr-001009
00:58:40.620 --> 00:58:44.600
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But, meron ho kaming public assistance sa program.

asr-001010
00:58:44.840 --> 00:58:46.620
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Bigay po nila sa amin yung complaint.

asr-001011
00:58:46.800 --> 00:58:49.640
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Maganda po ang record namin doon sa contact center ng bayan,

asr-001012
00:58:49.800 --> 00:58:51.020
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: at saka help desk.

asr-001013
00:58:51.300 --> 00:58:55.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And I want it na hindi na lang taga-tanggap ng complaint,

asr-001014
00:58:55.580 --> 00:58:56.840
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: at saka taga-refer ng complaint.

asr-001015
00:58:57.220 --> 00:58:58.820
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We have, she said it already, sir,

asr-001016
00:58:58.820 --> 00:59:04.260
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: na yung desk na yon ay hindi na lang mag-refer at saka mag-tanggap.

asr-001017
00:59:04.660 --> 00:59:10.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Mag-provide ng legal services or additional services.

asr-001018
00:59:10.620 --> 00:59:14.300
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: To, to help the person who is in a particular position.

asr-001019
00:59:14.300 --> 00:59:16.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: O kahit hotline siguro.

asr-001020
00:59:16.280 --> 00:59:18.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We have, we have the Contact Center ng Bayan.

asr-001021
00:59:19.000 --> 00:59:19.080
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001022
00:59:19.760 --> 00:59:23.260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sana naman pag kinontak nila, hindi sila masibak the following week.

asr-001023
00:59:23.440 --> 00:59:24.000
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ah, hindi po.

asr-001024
00:59:24.020 --> 00:59:24.720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Lalo pang madib.

asr-001025
00:59:24.720 --> 00:59:26.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Hindi po, kasi may confidentiality.

asr-001026
00:59:26.100 --> 00:59:27.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sumbong ka pa kay Attorney Yap, ha?

asr-001027
00:59:28.080 --> 00:59:28.900
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ay, ay, opo.

asr-001028
00:59:28.900 --> 00:59:31.740
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ako na pong bahala doon pag...

asr-001029
00:59:31.740 --> 00:59:33.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kahapon nandito na siya sa NCR.

asr-001030
00:59:33.800 --> 00:59:34.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Natapon siya doon sa Tawi-Tawi.

asr-001031
00:59:34.860 --> 00:59:36.620
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ah, hindi po pwede yun, hindi po pwede yun.

asr-001032
00:59:36.860 --> 00:59:37.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: O, yun, o, yun.

asr-001033
00:59:37.600 --> 00:59:39.380
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Habang nandun po ako sa Civil Service Commission.

asr-001034
00:59:39.400 --> 00:59:39.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ay, salamat po.

asr-001035
00:59:40.100 --> 00:59:40.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001036
00:59:40.680 --> 00:59:41.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you very much, attorney.

asr-001037
00:59:41.760 --> 00:59:42.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001038
00:59:42.860 --> 00:59:43.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Maraming salamat.

asr-001039
00:59:43.560 --> 00:59:45.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Now, let's move on to Career Executive Service Board.

asr-001040
00:59:45.800 --> 00:59:47.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ah, who's going to make a presentation?

asr-001041
00:59:47.920 --> 00:59:48.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kayo po yun?

asr-001042
00:59:48.660 --> 00:59:49.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yeah.

