asr-001460
01:30:14.200 --> 01:30:15.220
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001461
01:30:16.140 --> 01:30:20.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you, Secretary Matay.

asr-001462
01:30:23.620 --> 01:30:24.420
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001463
01:30:24.420 --> 01:30:30.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay. ComSec, who's, what agency or attached agency that will make a presentation?

asr-001464
01:30:31.380 --> 01:30:34.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero before that, I have one quick question, Secretary.

asr-001465
01:30:35.440 --> 01:30:45.080
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Your proposal, 12.12749, ang naaprubahan lang sa NEP is 4.29 billion?

asr-001466
01:30:45.880 --> 01:30:46.480
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Yes po.

asr-001467
01:30:46.940 --> 01:30:51.420
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dito sa 12 billion na ito, kasama na yung pinakita ninyo, yung mga requests ninyo

asr-001468
01:30:52.280 --> 01:30:54.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: about doon sa OSEC.

asr-001469
01:30:54.020 --> 01:30:55.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: These are all OSEC?

asr-001470
01:30:56.460 --> 01:30:56.660
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Yes.

asr-001471
01:30:57.120 --> 01:31:00.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung 11.592.000 OSEC po ito?

asr-001472
01:31:02.720 --> 01:31:05.860
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Mr. Chair, may I answer the question po?

asr-001473
01:31:06.020 --> 01:31:06.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Please.

asr-001474
01:31:06.460 --> 01:31:11.780
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: For the 4.029 billion, that is actually in our NEP,

asr-001475
01:31:12.240 --> 01:31:21.500
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: the amount of 82 million or the breakdown which is indicated in our presentation,

asr-001476
01:31:21.500 --> 01:31:23.540
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: they are not yet indicated.

asr-001477
01:31:24.020 --> 01:31:27.800
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: These are additional priority projects, your Honor.

asr-001478
01:31:28.420 --> 01:31:31.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Great. Thank you. ComSec, who's next to present?

asr-001479
01:31:39.640 --> 01:31:42.280
Committee Secretary: Hindi na muna kayo magtatanong first, Osec?

asr-001480
01:31:43.340 --> 01:31:47.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: No. Who's next to present?

asr-001481
01:31:47.460 --> 01:31:51.720
Committee Secretary: First attached agency to present is the Tourism Promotions Board.

asr-001482
01:31:51.760 --> 01:31:52.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001483
01:31:52.260 --> 01:31:53.460
Committee Secretary: To be followed by the...

asr-001484
01:31:54.020 --> 01:31:57.360
Committee Secretary: Duty Free Philippines Corporation.

asr-001485
01:31:57.360 --> 01:32:32.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Para mabilis tayo, ganito na lamang, for every presentation I'll be asking questions. Since yung OSEC po, quickly lamang po, Secretary, 3.3 billion po ang unused appropriations ng DOT-OSEC. September na po tayo, magtatapos na po ang taon. Bakit ang baba po ng utilization rate ng DOTC? I believe, ma'am, this is one of the reason kaya yung request ninyo na 12 billion ay hindi binigay, kundi ang binigay lang ay 4 billion kasi yung inyong utilization ay mababa.

asr-001486
01:32:32.620 --> 01:32:33.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, gets nyo po?

asr-001487
01:32:34.340 --> 01:32:41.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Siyempre, parang tatay po ako, bibigyan ko po ikaw, anak ko, hihingi ka pa, kailangan ko ng 1,000 for this week.

asr-001488
01:32:42.180 --> 01:32:46.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tapos tatanungin kita middle of the week, Wednesday, magkano pa ang pera mo dyan?

asr-001489
01:32:46.780 --> 01:32:48.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nako pa, meron pa akong 800 dito.

asr-001490
01:32:49.580 --> 01:32:50.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hihingi ka na naman sa Monday.

asr-001491
01:32:50.860 --> 01:32:52.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Siyempre, isipin ko marami ka pang budget.

asr-001492
01:32:53.380 --> 01:32:54.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: But what happened?

asr-001493
01:32:54.700 --> 01:32:58.220
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Mr. Senator, pwede po bang bigyan namin ng explanation?

asr-001494
01:32:58.420 --> 01:32:59.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Go ahead, go ahead.

asr-001495
01:32:59.280 --> 01:33:01.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yes, Yusek, I understand, I understand.

asr-001496
01:33:01.280 --> 01:33:01.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: You're new here.

asr-001497
01:33:02.240 --> 01:33:03.920
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yeah, Yusek Guillermo, go ahead.

asr-001498
01:33:04.580 --> 01:33:05.800
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-001499
01:33:06.380 --> 01:33:11.100
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: As of September 28, Your Honor, we already have, yes, 56%, po.

asr-001500
01:33:11.700 --> 01:33:18.240
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Not the previously reported na 35%, which was in June 2026.

asr-001501
01:33:18.460 --> 01:33:23.800
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: The utilization was purely affected by earlier, po, na since we are,

asr-001502
01:33:24.020 --> 01:33:29.480
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: we have a new administration, there's a re-calibration, po, of our priorities.

asr-001503
01:33:29.480 --> 01:33:35.480
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: But we are expecting to accelerate na po significantly beginning October,

asr-001504
01:33:35.480 --> 01:33:41.120
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: particularly with the obligation of major programs, po, under the tourism branding campaign,

asr-001505
01:33:41.120 --> 01:33:44.900
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: industry training programs that was presented early on,

asr-001506
01:33:44.900 --> 01:33:48.040
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: as well as the market and product development initiatives.

asr-001507
01:33:48.040 --> 01:33:52.780
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: So we therefore expect po yung substantial improvement po in our utilization rate

asr-001508
01:33:52.780 --> 01:33:53.980
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: towards the end of the year.

asr-001509
01:33:53.980 --> 01:34:00.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: All right, okay.

asr-001510
01:34:00.380 --> 01:34:06.920
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ngayon po, since, matagal na po kayo, Yusek Guillermo, I mean,

asr-001511
01:34:06.920 --> 01:34:11.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: or you just arrived also together with Secretary Matay.

asr-001512
01:34:11.300 --> 01:34:13.100
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Yes.

asr-001513
01:34:13.100 --> 01:34:13.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001514
01:34:13.480 --> 01:34:17.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi ang tatanong ko po, I don't know who can answer this dito po sa DOT natin.

asr-001515
01:34:17.880 --> 01:34:22.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: 2025 fiscal year, DOT reported unpaid obligations amounting

asr-001516
01:34:22.880 --> 01:34:25.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: to approximately 1.2 billion.

asr-001520
01:34:25.860 --> 01:34:30.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May we know the current status of these unpaid obligations and what accounts for the delay

asr-001521
01:34:30.040 --> 01:34:31.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: in the settlement?

asr-001522
01:34:31.380 --> 01:34:32.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or nasettle na po ba ito?

asr-001523
01:34:32.960 --> 01:34:34.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Would you know the answer, Yusek Maria?

asr-001524
01:34:35.160 --> 01:34:37.880
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Yes, Your Honor, if I may.

asr-001525
01:34:38.200 --> 01:34:46.100
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: So as of December 31, 2025, yes, you did mention po na there's 1.2 billion in unpaid obligations.

asr-001526
01:34:46.660 --> 01:34:51.280
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: We are pleased actually to report that this has already been substantially reduced

asr-001527
01:34:51.280 --> 01:34:55.040
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: under the term of Secretary.

asr-001528
01:34:55.040 --> 01:35:10.000
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: Dita here, with only 315.9 million na pong remaining outstanding. And the remaining balance primarily pertains now to contracts with milestones po. Ibig sabihin sila po yung may deliverables muna bago po tayo magbayad.

asr-001529
01:35:10.000 --> 01:35:15.880
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: And once these requirements are completed and validated, the department will immediately process the corresponding payment.

asr-001536
01:35:15.880 --> 01:35:20.040
DOT Undersecretary Ma. Dionesa A. Rivera-Guillermo: So we are targeting po, by end of this year, 100 percent po kami.

asr-001537
01:35:20.060 --> 01:35:20.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Very good po.

asr-001538
01:35:20.840 --> 01:35:22.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Very good.

asr-001539
01:35:22.940 --> 01:35:23.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nice to hear that.

asr-001540
01:35:23.980 --> 01:35:33.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Magkano naman po ang inilalaan para sa 2027 budget sa Tourism Road Infrastructure Program?

asr-001541
01:35:34.280 --> 01:35:38.220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Totoo po bang narinig ko na zero daw po ang funding ng trip?

asr-001542
01:35:38.960 --> 01:35:44.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kakausap ko lamang po sa dalawang mayor po sa Busuanga, mayor ng Busuanga, mayor ng Coron.

asr-001543
01:35:44.700 --> 01:35:55.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: When I went to visit that place around July, naghihingi po sila ng funding para from the airport,

asr-001544
01:35:56.500 --> 01:36:00.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: diretso po doon sa beaches nila, sa Busuanga and Coron, isang island lang po yun.

asr-001545
01:36:01.460 --> 01:36:04.420
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Chinay ko nga po, bitak-bitak na po yung kalsada.

asr-001546
01:36:06.220 --> 01:36:12.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Saan po tayo kukuha ng pondo? Paano natin may repair? Is it DPWH na po ngayon yung trip?

asr-001547
01:36:13.100 --> 01:36:14.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dati po, malaki po ang pondo.

asr-001548
01:36:14.700 --> 01:36:16.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano nangyari dito?

asr-001549
01:36:16.800 --> 01:36:18.080
DOT Undersecretary Maria Victoria V. Jasmin: May I be recognized?

asr-001550
01:36:18.460 --> 01:36:19.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Please, Usec Jasmin.

asr-001551
01:36:20.280 --> 01:36:30.480
DOT Undersecretary Maria Victoria V. Jasmin: Yes, the DOT has proposed a 6.02 billion budget for our Tourism Road Infrastructure Program,

asr-001552
01:36:30.860 --> 01:36:34.120
DOT Undersecretary Maria Victoria V. Jasmin: which covers about 28 projects.

asr-001553
01:36:34.760 --> 01:36:44.080
DOT Undersecretary Maria Victoria V. Jasmin: However, you're right, there is no funding for the trip projects under the fiscal year of 2027.

asr-001554
01:36:44.080 --> 01:36:44.560
DOT Undersecretary Maria Victoria V. Jasmin: So,

asr-001555
01:36:44.700 --> 01:36:45.320
DOT Undersecretary Maria Victoria V. Jasmin: it has.

asr-001556
01:36:46.140 --> 01:36:54.740
DOT Undersecretary Maria Victoria V. Jasmin: Apparently, DPWH has several priorities and DOT is not one of the priorities.

asr-001557
01:36:55.420 --> 01:36:56.420
DOT Undersecretary Maria Victoria V. Jasmin: But moving forward,

asr-001558
01:36:56.500 --> 01:37:00.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: how do we expect our tourism will go up?

asr-001559
01:37:00.460 --> 01:37:03.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung pangit po yung kalsada, biyak-biyak.

asr-001560
01:37:03.680 --> 01:37:06.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, I've seen a lot. I've been going around.

asr-001561
01:37:06.920 --> 01:37:10.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I came from Palawan. I grew up in Palawan.

asr-001562
01:37:10.800 --> 01:37:13.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mindoro, Marinduque, Rumblon.

asr-001563
01:37:13.000 --> 01:37:13.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I represent that.

asr-001564
01:37:13.960 --> 01:37:14.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May Maropa region.

asr-001565
01:37:15.460 --> 01:37:18.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Even Marinduque po, they have wonderful beaches.

asr-001566
01:37:18.500 --> 01:37:20.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Unfortunately, hindi nga po marating.

asr-001567
01:37:21.220 --> 01:37:23.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dahil, Pierre, wala rin po.

asr-001568
01:37:23.680 --> 01:37:24.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Airport, wala rin.

asr-001569
01:37:24.840 --> 01:37:25.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May airport.

asr-001570
01:37:25.500 --> 01:37:26.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero tinutubuan na ng damo.

asr-001571
01:37:27.120 --> 01:37:28.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ginagawang pastula nila ng kambing.

asr-001572
01:37:29.460 --> 01:37:30.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: How do you expect this?

asr-001573
01:37:31.000 --> 01:37:39.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Our number will go up dito sa tourism arrivals kung hindi natin maayos itong mga problema na ito.

asr-001574
01:37:39.100 --> 01:37:41.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero may request po kayo, Secretary, dito,

asr-001575
01:37:41.680 --> 01:37:43.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: na maglagay po ng tourism.

asr-001576
01:37:43.960 --> 01:37:46.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Road infrastructure program this year.

asr-001577
01:37:46.640 --> 01:37:49.260
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Kung hindi po masyadong tight ang fiscal space,

asr-001578
01:37:49.500 --> 01:37:52.320
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: it will benefit us, as you put it quite eloquently, sir.

asr-001579
01:37:52.340 --> 01:37:52.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ito ang DPWH.

asr-001580
01:37:53.000 --> 01:37:56.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi po pa dati this was under DOT?

asr-001581
01:37:57.340 --> 01:38:00.920
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Sir po, may convergence po ang DPWH at DOT.

asr-001582
01:38:01.320 --> 01:38:04.520
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Tapos, sometime along this year, sinabi nila,

asr-001583
01:38:04.640 --> 01:38:05.960
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: ipat na sa amin lahat.

asr-001584
01:38:06.240 --> 01:38:08.440
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Tapos, nung humingi kami, hindi naman po binigyan.

asr-001585
01:38:08.440 --> 01:38:11.720
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Pero kung mayroon pa rin pong space,

asr-001586
01:38:12.100 --> 01:38:13.940
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: kung maaari po may bigay na po sa amin,

asr-001587
01:38:13.960 --> 01:38:15.540
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: at kami naman mag-i-implement.

asr-001588
01:38:15.640 --> 01:38:18.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Oo nga, kasi baka mapunta lang sa flood control ito.

asr-001589
01:38:18.560 --> 01:38:19.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ang malaking problema.

asr-001590
01:38:20.180 --> 01:38:21.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Maraming yayaman dito.

asr-001591
01:38:21.820 --> 01:38:24.080
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Siguro, palagay ko, kaya inalis sa inyo.

asr-001592
01:38:24.880 --> 01:38:30.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dahil, mapupunta lang sa daan, napapunta sa kalsabulsa nila.

asr-001593
01:38:30.620 --> 01:38:34.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Anyway, so wala pong pondo ang 2027 trip natin.

asr-001594
01:38:35.480 --> 01:38:36.060
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Yes po.

asr-001595
01:38:36.260 --> 01:38:38.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, you're requesting for funding for this?

asr-001596
01:38:38.820 --> 01:38:39.960
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Yes po, kung maaari po.

asr-001597
01:38:40.220 --> 01:38:41.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Different po ito sa Tieza?

asr-001598
01:38:42.640 --> 01:38:43.600
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Different po.

asr-001599
01:38:43.600 --> 01:38:44.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Different.

asr-001600
01:38:44.400 --> 01:38:45.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mamaya po I'll ask TIEZA.

asr-001601
01:38:45.740 --> 01:38:52.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Anyway, so, mga to the tune of magkano kaya on top of your head po is,

asr-001602
01:38:53.240 --> 01:38:54.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ilan po ang kakailanganin?

asr-001603
01:38:54.920 --> 01:38:55.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi marami.

asr-001604
01:38:55.560 --> 01:38:57.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Doon pa lang sa amin, sa probinsya ko po,

asr-001605
01:38:57.640 --> 01:39:01.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: nagre-request na po ng kalsada yung isang island po na yun,

asr-001606
01:39:01.560 --> 01:39:03.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: parang circumferential road.

asr-001607
01:39:03.540 --> 01:39:06.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi lahat naman po yung Busuanga and Coron,

asr-001608
01:39:06.640 --> 01:39:07.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: napapalibutan po ng beaches.

asr-001609
01:39:08.900 --> 01:39:10.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, ito po yung nire-request nila.

asr-001610
01:39:10.700 --> 01:39:12.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi ko alam kung saan hukukuha.

asr-001611
01:39:12.580 --> 01:39:13.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Doon pala sa inyo.

asr-001612
01:39:13.600 --> 01:39:13.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sa trip.

asr-001613
01:39:14.520 --> 01:39:17.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, approximately, mga magkano po ito?

asr-001614
01:39:17.320 --> 01:39:22.240
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Sir, kung po pwede po, 6 billion po for the trip program.

asr-001615
01:39:23.460 --> 01:39:27.240
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Kasi, sir, sir, ano po, 28 projects po kasi ito.

asr-001616
01:39:27.600 --> 01:39:29.540
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: And ito po, navet na ng maigi.

asr-001617
01:39:30.100 --> 01:39:34.760
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: At saka, ano na, it passed all the criteria po na ito talaga.

asr-001618
01:39:34.780 --> 01:39:35.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mas malaki ba sa budget nyo?

asr-001619
01:39:35.940 --> 01:39:36.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Diyos ko po naman.

asr-001620
01:39:36.580 --> 01:39:37.240
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Kaya nga, sir.

asr-001621
01:39:38.520 --> 01:39:39.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright, 6 billion.

asr-001622
01:39:39.540 --> 01:39:41.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: For how many projects is this?

asr-001623
01:39:41.060 --> 01:39:41.700
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: 28 po.

asr-001624
01:39:41.960 --> 01:39:42.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: 28.

asr-001625
01:39:43.600 --> 01:39:46.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And then, kung ano na ito, overdue na.

asr-001626
01:39:46.660 --> 01:39:46.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tama?

asr-001627
01:39:46.880 --> 01:39:47.300
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Yes, sir.

asr-001628
01:39:47.420 --> 01:39:47.820
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Yes, sir.

asr-001629
01:39:48.240 --> 01:39:53.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero, tell me, is this one of the reason why yung accessibility ng mga tao,

asr-001630
01:39:53.100 --> 01:39:55.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: hindi lang yung mga foreigners, pati tayo, mga Pilipino,

asr-001631
01:39:55.480 --> 01:39:58.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: because tatamarin na pagpunta doon because sira ang kalsada,

asr-001632
01:39:59.560 --> 01:40:01.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: masukal, doon maganda yung lugar,

asr-001633
01:40:01.740 --> 01:40:06.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kailangan mo munang magsakripisyo bago ka makarating sa isang tourist destination?

asr-001634
01:40:06.740 --> 01:40:07.560
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Tama po yun.

asr-001635
01:40:08.060 --> 01:40:11.340
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: That's a serious accessibility issue.

asr-001636
01:40:11.340 --> 01:40:13.520
DOT Secretary Dita Angara-Mathay: Na sana po, eh, ano,

