asr-002806
02:32:27.140 --> 02:32:43.080
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: The Nayong Pilipino Foundation is focused on establishing a cultural hub that inspires Filipino creativity, green spaces, and sustainable park operation, in addition to supporting the Philippine tourism industry through research, development, and training.

asr-002807
02:32:43.920 --> 02:32:55.140
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: Pending the development of the Nayong Pilipino Cultural Park, which is currently under review, we are at the helm of dissemination of our programs on Macanayon, Filipinization,

asr-002808
02:32:55.380 --> 02:32:56.220
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: Palengke Tourism,

asr-002814
02:32:56.880 --> 02:32:59.440
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: and soon our festival management program.

asr-002815
02:33:00.480 --> 02:33:08.240
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We have trained 1,246 persons from 17 regions from various schools and LGUs.

asr-002816
02:33:08.880 --> 02:33:11.840
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We have 3,000 artifacts for our museum,

asr-002817
02:33:11.840 --> 02:33:20.180
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: which we have displayed at the Clark Expo site in Pampanga for 14 years from 2007 to 2021

asr-002818
02:33:20.180 --> 02:33:26.800
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: and at the Tarlac Provincial Museum for the past three years, 2023 to 2026.

asr-002819
02:33:27.200 --> 02:33:31.460
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We now have select artifacts on display at the Ayala Museum,

asr-002820
02:33:32.300 --> 02:33:38.860
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: the Talikang Pilipino Gallery II, the National Museum in Iloilo, and the National Museum in Zamboanga.

asr-002821
02:33:39.200 --> 02:33:43.720
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: Our current space, while awaiting our park development program,

asr-002822
02:33:44.380 --> 02:33:47.920
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: is currently maintaining a bike trail of 3 kilometers,

asr-002823
02:33:48.620 --> 02:33:53.800
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: an arboretum with 3,000 native trees developed with the Energy Development Corporation,

asr-002824
02:33:54.600 --> 02:33:56.160
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: an area for disc golf,

asr-002825
02:33:56.160 --> 02:33:57.800
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: and an area for camping.

asr-002826
02:33:58.380 --> 02:34:01.240
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: This is a favorite place for nature and sports enthusiasts,

asr-002827
02:34:01.960 --> 02:34:06.940
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: and for 2025 till today, we have had 6,500 visitors.

asr-002828
02:34:07.900 --> 02:34:12.280
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: Our park development program is a priority of the current Board of Trustees.

asr-002829
02:34:12.860 --> 02:34:18.780
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We are updating the Comprehensive Master Plan, which was prepared by a previous board in 2021.

asr-002830
02:34:19.560 --> 02:34:23.180
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We are updating the NEDA-approved 2 billion budget,

asr-002831
02:34:23.180 --> 02:34:25.460
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: as endorsed by Secretary Frasco,

asr-002832
02:34:25.460 --> 02:34:27.460
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: approved in 2024,

asr-002833
02:34:27.460 --> 02:34:29.460
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: and effective till 2028.

asr-002834
02:34:29.460 --> 02:34:35.460
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We are reviewing other possible financial options with PPP, etc.,

asr-002835
02:34:35.460 --> 02:34:41.460
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: and we are finalizing procurement process to have a consultant prepare our feasibility study.

asr-002836
02:34:41.460 --> 02:34:51.460
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We are eagerly moving forward on this project to be able to provide the Filipino people a truly cultural park they will enjoy and be proud of.

asr-002837
02:34:51.540 --> 02:34:53.320
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: The Nayong Pilipino Foundation

asr-002838
02:34:53.320 --> 02:34:54.920
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: does not receive a budget

asr-002839
02:34:54.920 --> 02:34:56.080
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: from the national government.

asr-002840
02:34:56.460 --> 02:34:57.760
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: Our resources come from

asr-002841
02:34:57.760 --> 02:34:59.260
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: our corporate investment fund

asr-002842
02:34:59.260 --> 02:35:01.280
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: and revenue from our activities.

asr-002843
02:35:01.780 --> 02:35:03.580
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We ensure that we only spend

asr-002844
02:35:03.580 --> 02:35:04.920
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: what we have on hand.

asr-002849
02:35:05.740 --> 02:35:22.520
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: But we also pay our taxes and dividends, and as of today, dividends, 17 million, real property taxes up to 2026 is 539 million, and BIR income taxes, a total of 173 million.

asr-002850
02:35:23.600 --> 02:35:32.320
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: Our annual budget allocation is for payment of taxes alone, particularly RPT, is about 30% of our budget.

asr-002851
02:35:32.320 --> 02:35:46.460
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: Our budget for 2027 is 73 million, with personnel services, 20 million, MOOE is 50 million, and capital outlay of 1.378.

asr-002852
02:35:46.940 --> 02:35:56.300
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We are aware that we also need to earn revenue from other sources, so we are working on the following revenue-generating activities.

asr-002853
02:35:56.300 --> 02:36:01.180
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: We have a partnership with the National Youth Commission for the integration of the Bacanayan Cores,

asr-002854
02:36:01.900 --> 02:36:02.300
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: partnership with

asr-002855
02:36:02.300 --> 02:36:04.200
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: various colleges and universities,

asr-002856
02:36:04.500 --> 02:36:08.140
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: partnership with the Department of Tourism and DILG for LGU training,

asr-002857
02:36:09.040 --> 02:36:12.460
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: site activation projects like disc golf, biking, camping,

asr-002858
02:36:13.140 --> 02:36:19.200
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: partnership with the Disc Golf Association for an international tournament with 12 countries,

asr-002859
02:36:19.700 --> 02:36:23.260
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: and partnership with the Boy Scouts of the Philippines for their camping site.

asr-002860
02:36:24.100 --> 02:36:30.680
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: Our other performance indicators include ARTA, Customer Satisfaction Rating of 97.82,

asr-002861
02:36:30.680 --> 02:36:32.280
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: we are ISO,

asr-002862
02:36:32.300 --> 02:36:34.020
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: 9,001 certified,

asr-002863
02:36:34.800 --> 02:36:39.220
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: our GCG PES scorecard is 97% in 2025,

asr-002864
02:36:40.020 --> 02:36:43.200
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: our budget utilization is currently at 53%,

asr-002865
02:36:43.200 --> 02:36:48.220
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: as we will still be paying our RPT year-end for the 2027 season.

asr-002866
02:36:49.980 --> 02:36:56.260
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: So, this is my presentation now, Secretary, Senator, yeah.

asr-002867
