NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: Actually, sir, we left Tarlac Museum, all our artifacts were there, just this year, 2026.

asr-002877
02:37:27.100 --> 02:37:31.180
NPF Executive Director Leonila R. Fabul: But we have a site, sir, in Paranaque.

asr-002878
02:37:31.180 --> 02:37:32.940
